VLM Precision Lab

experiments/qwen_offload_compat.py adapts the Qwen visual-position offload
workaround from vllm-project/llm-compressor pull request 1958, Apache-2.0.
https://github.com/vllm-project/llm-compressor/pull/1958

The quantization adapter uses LLM Compressor's AWQ example and public APIs.
Quantization kernels, AWQ scaling, packing and execution remain upstream work.
https://github.com/vllm-project/llm-compressor

The optional receipt adapter reads NAVER CLOVA CORD-v2 annotations and images
under CC-BY-4.0. No source images or parquet data are bundled with this code.
https://github.com/clovaai/cord
https://huggingface.co/datasets/naver-clova-ix/cord-v2
